WEBVTT

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.330
Okay, guys!

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.250
Get your sake cups ready!

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.830
"Sake cups"...?

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.460
Why am I part of this?

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.670
This ritual will bond us 
together in sisterhood!

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.920
It's our way of celebrating Chino's 
decision
to come to our school!

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.000
I haven't even filled out 
a formal request yet...

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:20.040
So it shall be! Let us unite once 
again
upon the school grounds!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.250
Yes!

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.460
Y-yes...

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.500
Cheers!

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.880
May I trouble you for a cup of coffee?

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.000
Miss Aoyama?!

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:34.670
When did you...?

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.750
Has Miss Aoyama come here?!

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.170
Sensei!

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:43.330
I'm so happy to have Miss Aoyama
as one 
of my regular patrons at Ama Usa An.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:44.460
Oh, of course!

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.250
Uh, thanks for having her!

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:48.540
Let me give you my business card!

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.500
You don't have to.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.380
U-um...

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:54.380
If you're looking for Miss Aoyama, then...

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.210
Ah! Sensei! Get back here!

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.790
They're a real pair of busybodies, huh?

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.210
I bet they run around nearly all day long.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.750
Almost like a marathon.

00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:11.130
That reminds me, our school
is 
having a marathon this month!

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:15.460
Huh?! A marathon... that 
means we have to run, right?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:16.580
Obviously!

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.540
We've gotta step up to fill the dual 
role
of big sister and senpai! Right?

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.330
Big sister and senpai...

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.960
I'll make it to the finish 
line no matter what!

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.170
I swear it upon our sake cups of sisterhood!

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:31.500
Whoa!

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.880
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.960
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.630
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:47.330
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:50.500
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.880
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.960
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:00.080
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:06.170
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte 
(Arieru koto yori arienai koto)

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:12.210
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite 
(Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.790
Sugar yori cinnamon ga

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:18.670
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.040
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:25.080
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:28.130
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:30.330
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.080
Kuruntto hitomawari hora 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.330
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance 
dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:41.000
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.580
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:46.960
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:49.960
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:56.080
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto 
tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.080
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.210
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:18.880
Chiya?!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.710
Oh, hi, Rize.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:23.960
Such an invigorating morning, isn't it...?

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.420
What are you doing?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.750
Training for the upcoming marathon!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.580
Are you planning to run 
through mountains or what?!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.420
Good grief!

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:36.000
I've been training myself in the hopes
of 
crossing the finish line together with Cocoa.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.540
You're taking it way too far.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.290
Do you go running every morning?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.580
No, I actually just started today.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:46.380
To be honest, I've been eating too many 
sweets lately
and it's affected my weight...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.040
Oh, hey!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.170
Why don't we run together?!

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:50.880
Huh?

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:53.880
But I'm a very slow runner...

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.290
No worries! I'll match your pace!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.830
I won't get left behind if we do this!

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.080
Okay, Rize! Go!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.500
When did this become a dog walk?!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.920
The air feels so crisp and refreshing!

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:17.710
Yes it does...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:21.790
And the town has such a 
unique vibe in the morning!

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.250
Well, none of the shops are open yet...

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.540
It's so quiet it seems like 
a totally different place!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:34.580
Anyways, I can't believe you decided to train 
yourself
just to finish the race together with Cocoa!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.380
I really admire your determination
to face 
your own shortcomings in the name of friendshi-

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.080
Chiya?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.250
I can't go on...

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:46.000
But we only just started running!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.380
Grrr....!

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.960
What are you, a dog that hates walks?

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.920
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.420
All of this swelling... maybe 
it's from muscle fatigue?

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:02.080
Muscle fatigue? That's unusual for you.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:05.920
Well, I started training this 
morning
to prep for the marathon.

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.040
That's amazing!

00:05:07.630 --> 00:05:08.710
On the day of...

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.500
I'm going to draw all sorts 
of attention to Ama Usa An!

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.920
And make it to the goal with you!

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:23.040
This fierce energy... I get the feeling that she's 
willing
to cast me aside if it means getting first place!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:28.580
And so, I'm going to start jogging in the 
mornings
to make sure Chiya doesn't leave me in the dust!

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.460
Tag along with me, Rize!

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.130
Can you even get up that early?

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.210
Just who do you think I am?!

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.670
Bakers are masters of getting up early!

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:40.290
And I'm Cocoa, the proud 
daughter of a family of bakers!

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.080
Okay, sure.

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.710
You better be awake.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:46.710
Right! I need you to be 
my alarm clock, Chino!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:47.830
I'd rather not.

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.460
Get up on your own!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.540
Let's all take up jogging!

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:58.250
Hello, Chino speaking.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.330
Cocoa isn't waking up at all.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:02.960
I figured as much.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.750
Sorry about this. Give me 
a ring when she gets up.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.380
I'm sorry for being late!

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.460
You're so reliable, Chiya!

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:12.170
Huh?

00:06:16.420 --> 00:06:18.250
I'm at my limit...

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.130
Keep it up! Just a little further!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:26.580
W-would you mind if we shouted something
so 
I can try and psyche myself up?

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.170
Sure, let's play the word chain game!

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.960
A... Apple tart!

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.170
T... Toasted mochi in a seaweed roll...

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.460
L... Lollipops!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:39.830
S... Strawberry mochi with sweet filling...

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:43.920
G.... Gelatin with sweet soybeans...

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:47.960
And dango on top of anmitsu...

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:51.130
With a matcha parfait!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:54.130
Please come to Ama Usa 
An for the best desserts!

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.460
What is this, a commercial?!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.380
You're doing great!

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:05.250
Here, for you.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.880
A stamp card?

00:07:06.880 --> 00:07:09.420
Tracking progress like this
helps 
with motivation, ya know?

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.920
Rize! I'm going to do my absolute best!

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.080
That's the spirit!

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:18.460
Let's aim for you to not only catch up 
to Cocoa,
but surpass her entirely!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.960
Hm? What's up?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:24.790
I wonder if I should start 
a stamp card for Ama Usa An.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.920
What would be the reward for completing it?

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.670
All you can eat shiruko sweet 
porridge for 90 minutes!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.290
Hard to decide if that's something
to 
be happy about or not...

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.290
Anyways, let's keep this up again tomorrow!

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:36.250
Okay!

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.710
What? Chiya's started training?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.710
That's right!

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:43.210
Oh... now that you mention it.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.080
She's gone jogging every morning lately.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:50.580
And she's kept it up despite
being 
pretty athletically challenged.

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:55.460
Yeah, and the look on her face
has 
totally stared to resemble Rize!

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:58.170
I'm gonna be left in the 
dust if this keeps up!

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:00.710
Then you should just go jogging with her.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:03.670
But I wanna train in secret from Chiya!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.420
Everything is such a hassle with you...

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:08.130
Syaro, please go jogging with me!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.330
No way.

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:12.330
Please, Syaro! I'm begging you!

00:08:13.500 --> 00:08:16.000
You promise you'll wake up on time?

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.670
Of course!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.460
Sorry to keep you!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.710
Oh! Nice hairdo!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:28.670
It's my good luck charm for the marathon!

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.330
So I can run just like 
my excellent instructor!

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.830
Okay, troops! Today we march 
through
the fires of Hell yet again!

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.880
That's not supposed to be 
an impression of me, is it?!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.000
I can't get a response...
I'll 
check.
She's asleep...

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:48.460
I KNEW THIS WOULD HAPPEN!

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.420
Just a little further 
and we'll be at the top!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.710
You did it, Chiya!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:12.000
Never in my wildest dreams...
did 
I think I could run so much...

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.540
I didn't know I had it in me!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:20.580
It's so beautiful.

00:09:21.130 --> 00:09:22.540
It really is.

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:28.080
I discovered a lot of new things 
while training with you.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.380
Want to keep it up after the marathon ends?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.080
Nah. I can't stay motivated 
without some sort of goal.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.880
Then how about you enter a triathlon?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:39.130
Just the thought of it is enough to kill me.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:42.170
Well, you and Cocoa can definitely
finish 
the marathon today!

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:43.330
Thanks!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:47.170
I was able to keep going 
because you stayed with me.

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:49.670
I'll be sure to enjoy myself out there!

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:52.290
We're compatriots now!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.130
Here, this is my way of saying thanks.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.210
AMA USA AN
ALL-YOU-CAN-EAT WAGASHI SWEETS 
GOOD FOR A 
1 HOUR PERIOD
FORGET THE WORD "CALORIES," AT LEAST FOR NOW

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.460
Is that a stamp card for Ama Usa An?

00:09:57.710 --> 00:09:59.170
You finished making it already?

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:06.380
AMA USA AN
ALL-YOU-CAN-EAT WAGASHI SWEETS 
GOOD FOR A 
1 HOUR PERIOD
FORGET THE WORD "CALORIES," AT LEAST FOR NOW

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.540
It's a coupon for all you 
can eat wagashi sweets!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.710
You remember the reason why 
I started jogging, right?!

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.630
No sign of them yet.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.920
There's Chiya!

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:22.670
Where's Cocoa?

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.670
She's got a hold of Chiya's 
hair like a pair of reins!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:31.420
Chiya... you accomplished your goal of making 
it
to the finish line without abandoning Cocoa.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.670
I never doubted you, my compatriot!

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.750
Rize!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.830
The pigtails came in really handy!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.130
I'm not happy to hear it!

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.790
Just a little more!

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.210
You can do it!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.000
Chiya...

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:47.960
I can't go on...

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.880
Don't give up... yet... Cocoa!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:54.630
We're going to finish... this race together!

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:01.460
As a pair of big sisters and senpai!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.460
We have to do it!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.630
Great job!

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:31.130
That was amazing!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.130
I'm honestly surprised 
Chiya made it to the end.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:38.670
I had faith in her!
I just knew 
that Chiya would come through!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:41.210
I owe it all to you guys.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:45.750
Rize, for jogging with me 
every morning. And Cocoa, too!

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:51.000
I wanted to run together with Senpai, too...

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.540
Oh! Then let's do it!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:56.080
Our new training regimen begins tomorrow!

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.380
Let's aim to conquer a triathlon!

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.130
Yeah!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:02.670
Wait! What did you say at the end there?!

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.960
Let's all do our best!

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:05.830
Yeah!

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.960
Don't act like you'll 
actually show up, Cocoa!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.000
She is a Fierce Whirlwind
Bunnisode 
5:
She is a Carefree Breeze

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.500
Great weather today.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:22.670
Indeed.

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:25.290
Miss Aoyama!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.790
Oh, well hello there.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:30.750
Why are you all dressed up?

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.210
Why indeed?

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:38.080
I was given a day off,
but I 
don't know what to do with myself.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:42.790
You're always busy working
on 
your manuscripts, after all.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.170
Then you should hang out with us!

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:46.880
You don't mind?

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.210
Not at all!

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.580
What would you like to do?

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.420
Well...

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.750
In that case, I'd like 
to relive my childhood,

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.750
by playing hide-and-seek!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:58.960
What do you think?

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.500
I'm in!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:03.460
Okay, I have just the 
person in mind to be "it".

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.420
I wonder who that is?

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.500
Is Miss Aoyama here?!

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.580
Sh-she hasn't come here today, I'm afraid.

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.790
You're Miss Aoyama's editor, right?

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:19.330
Yes! My name is Rin Mate.

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.540
Editorial Department

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:22.080
Thank you for always offering 
her your assistance.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.250
Sure, don't mention it.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.750
Is one of her manuscripts coming due?

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.630
No! She has the day off today.

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.080
Then what's going on?

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:33.460
I'm playing hide-and-seek with her today!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.170
How's that any different from the usual?!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.630
Are you sure you're okay 
getting dragged into this?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:45.080
We got word that Cocoa and Chiya
are 
helping Miss Aoyama out.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.330
So let's work together and catch them all!

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.830
This is the birth of the 
new "At-Their-Mercy" Corps!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.540
Hustle, hit, never quit!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:59.380
This kind of reminds me of my school days.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:00.250
B-behind you!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:01.290
Huh? Huh?!

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:03.670
Miss Aoyama!

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.580
They know where we are now...

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:07.130
We need to run away.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:09.080
Hold it!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:10.920
Okay, let's go.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.130
We lost track of them!

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:20.880
They're behind us!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.710
Sensei!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.500
There's no escape!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:25.880
Where are they hiding now?!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.290
Let's stop and think of a strategy to...

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.290
Behind us!

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:32.460
Get back here!

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.420
They're behind us!

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:43.580
Behind us!

00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:49.460
She's behind you...

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.040
We can't lay a finger on them.

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.460
I guess we should take a break.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:59.040
Things just never go well for 
me when I need them to...

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:03.710
Th-there they are!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:06.040
Oh no, Tippy!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.040
Catch!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.210
I think we should split up and then... huh?!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.210
Miss Rin, I found Miss Aoyama!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:15.880
Wait, no, she's over there now!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.580
What?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:17.880
Make up your mind!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:25.460
It looks like Rin has gotten 
comfortable
and made fast friends with Chino and Rize.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:31.000
I wanna hurry and get to know Miss Rin, too!
That 
way she'll start coming to Rabbit House more often!

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:34.040
But you won't be able to chat 
with her
unless they catch you.

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:37.710
Then let's find a good time 
and let ourselves get caught.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.040
As a group!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.080
We're in this together until the end!

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.670
If this was a novel, this is about the 
time
a traitor would appear as a plot twist.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.290
You've really got books for brains!

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:58.330
Cocoa!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.710
Cocoa!

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:03.630
Ch-Chino?!

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:06.670
I wonder where the other two are?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.250
This must be a trap!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:09.000
Huh?!

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:14.580
Don't you think it's out of character for 
Chino
to be running and waving at us like that?

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:18.630
Please come quick, Cocoa!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:21.540
Chino is calling for me...!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:23.670
Don't let her trick you!

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:27.210
That Chino over there isn't the 
same one
that you know and love!

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:29.290
Because she's "it" right now!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:31.830
Cocoa!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.080
Chino!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.830
I don't care if Chino is "it"!

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:40.830
Because as her big sister, I absolutely 
cannot
miss the chance for a hug like this!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.130
Cocoa...!

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.330
Chino!

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:49.080
Your big sister is on her way!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:52.790
Cocoa, I've caught you.

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.630
Way to go, Chino!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.000
Looks like she doesn't plan on trying 
to escape.
I can never run from this!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:03.420
Cocoa... so you betrayed us
to 
be together with Chino instead.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:07.130
She's the type of girl who lives 
and dies
in the name of love!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:12.330
Cocoa... I'll nebur fowget yew...

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.580
Alrighty, Miss Aoyama! Let's get a move on!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.460
Yes, let's.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.960
Wait!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:26.380
They split up!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:28.000
I've got Chiya!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.080
Thanks!

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:33.790
You've gotten speedy!
That must 
be because of our training!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.710
It's ironic, no? The instructor 
is now chasing the student.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.920
But it's too bad, because nothing can stop m-

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.540
Oh, it's a dead end.

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:46.710
Fine! Then just do with me what you wish!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.250
How courteous.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:56.290
Where did she get off to now?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.000
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.000
The Phantom Thief Lapin...

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:04.210
...is here!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:09.290
Come visit Fleur de Lapin for our
Phantom 
Thief Lapin collab event happening now!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.250
It's the real Phantom Thief Lapin!

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.500
That's Syaro.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:15.960
I wonder if I can get a 
bit of a closer look...

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.960
She's just a fangirl.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:21.460
I guess it makes since for the editor
to 
be the author's biggest fan!

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:23.540
E-excuse me...

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.630
If you don't mind, could I get a pict- wha?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:32.170
I impulsively peeked in 
on Syaro out of habit.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:32.710
Huh?!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:33.790
Farewell.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.630
H-hold it!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:37.710
Aoyama Sexual Harassment Mountain!

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.500
Hup!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:39.960
We gotta go, too!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:47.630
Whoa! What is that?! It's so cute!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.960
It's a rabbit carousel.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.790
Let's ride it, you guys!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.830
We've gotta find Miss Aoyama first!

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:56.130
Hey, Rin!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:58.040
I'm over here!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.000
She's riding it?!

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:01.170
Time for us to charge in, too!

00:19:01.420 --> 00:19:03.330
Now you can finally catch her.

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:05.330
We gotta ride that carousel!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:06.830
That's your goal?!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:08.540
C'mon, we're also gonna ride!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.920
Huh?!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.630
Jeez...

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:16.750
It's so pretty.

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:32.040
I haven't ridden on a 
carousel since I was a kid.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.380
Same here.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:41.380
Playing around like this certainly 
reminds me
of our high school days.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:46.580
You use whatever means it takes
to 
chase after me all the time.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:49.040
So I always escalate the situation.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:55.000
If Master saw me goofing around like this...

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.000
I wonder what he'd say?

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.830
I've finished it!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:06.830
Oh, really?

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:08.880
Congratulations.

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:11.170
The whole reason I was able to finish it,

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:14.210
was thanks to this fountain pen you lent me.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.080
Thank you so much.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:22.330
You should keep that 
fountain pen for yourself.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.130
Huh?

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:29.670
I'm sure the pen would be happier
being 
in the hands of a future novelist.

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.540
Master...!

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.750
Thank you!

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:38.630
I promise to provide it lots of joy.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.920
Please do.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:43.290
I've already decided on 
what my next story will be.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:46.170
Then please let me be the 
first one to read it again.

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:47.670
Of course.

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:52.920
You're just the same as you were then.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.250
Good grief.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.250
A voice from Heaven?!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.630
Master? Master?!

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:07.670
Sensei.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:09.210
Yes?

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:14.540
No matter how down on my luck I may get,
I 
promise I won't stop until I've caught you.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.040
Anyways...

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:22.290
I never thought I'd be chasing after 
you
even on my days off, Midori.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.040
I enjoyed our game today very much.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.080
And besides...

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.960
It's quite fitting for us, don't you think?

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:33.580
That's for sure.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:37.330
I'm ready.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.960
Okay, Midori... I caught you!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.880
You certainly did.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.500
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.290
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:03.830
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:07.670
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:11.460
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:15.500
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:19.210
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne

00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:23.080
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:27.210
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu

00:22:27.210 --> 00:22:33.210
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:36.750
Yappari...

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.540
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:44.330
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:48.330
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:52.380
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta

00:22:52.540 --> 00:22:56.250
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:59.920
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:02.000
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:07.330
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita

00:23:07.750 --> 00:23:13.750
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:17.790
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:19.290
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:23.540
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:29.000
Today turned out to be 
such a refreshing day off!

00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:30.750
So, will you make progress 
on your manuscript now?

00:23:30.750 --> 00:23:33.880
Ah! Ow, ow, ow... oh no, 
muscle fatigue is setting in.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:36.000
Bunnisode 6: A Fluffle of 
Rabbits is Also Most Welcome

00:23:33.880 --> 00:23:34.830
Come now, Aoyama...

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:35.710
Ow!
